  assumptions: 'Metres, Y-up. Original mounting origin retained. Three separate mesh/material
    groups: Frame, opaque unlit Luminous, removable SnowCap. Source rigid fixture
    already combines metal parts; original Blender modules are preserved. Narrow
    pole/base proxy avoids an invisible barrier under outreach arms; wall variant
    uses a compact fixture box. Decorative snow is outside the snow ledger. Optional
    point lights are saved under an inactive Editor-toggle group, shadowless with
    proposed URP intensity/range; Blender watts are provenance, not directly equivalent
    Unity intensity.'
  reviewNotes: Authorized prototype placement, not Ready publication. Review wall
    seating, pole collisions, night lighting and A07 timings.
